monte_carlo.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Original to this plugin. The upstream Cookbook skill advertised Monte Carlo
simulation in its SKILL.md but shipped no implementation of it; this module
fills that gap and adds the DCF integration layer.

It embeds two standard numerical approximations so that scipy is not required:

  - Inverse normal CDF: Peter Acklam's rational approximation
    (relative error < 1.15e-9)
  - Error function: Abramowitz & Stegun, Handbook of Mathematical Functions,
    formula 7.1.26 (absolute error < 1.5e-7)

Both are long-published algorithms in the public domain.
